Instanto TeaVM JSO Patch

Contains TeaVM JSO implementation 0.16.0, copyright Alexey Andreev and TeaVM
contributors, distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/konsoletyper/teavm/tree/0.16.0

JS.java, JSClassProcessor.java and JSNativeInjector.java are modified so a call
to a @JSTopLevel function is lowered to a plain global function call when the
JavaScript is generated, rather than to a member call on a null receiver that
an optimised build can leave in a variable. All other upstream class files are
included unchanged.
